{
  "mn123:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 123 ",
  "mn123:0.2": "Acchariyaabbhutasutta ",
  "mn123:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn123:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn123:2.1": "Atha kho sambahulānaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ pacchābhattaṁ piṇḍapātapaṭikkantānaṁ upaṭṭhānasālāyaṁ sannisinnānaṁ sannipatitānaṁ ayamantarākathā udapādi: ",
  "mn123:2.2": "“acchariyaṁ, āvuso, abbhutaṁ, āvuso. Tathāgatassa mahiddhikatā mahānubhāvatā, ",
  "mn123:2.3": "yatra hi nāma tathāgato atīte buddhe parinibbute chinnapapañce chinnavaṭume pariyādinnavaṭṭe sabbadukkhavītivatte jānissati: ",
  "mn123:2.4": "‘evaṁjaccā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṁnāmā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṅgottā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṁsīlā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṁdhammā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṁpaññā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṁvihārī te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipi, ‘evaṁvimuttā te bhagavanto ahesuṁ’ itipī”ti. ",
  "mn123:2.5": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā ānando te bhikkhū etadavoca: ",
  "mn123:2.6": "“acchariyā ceva, āvuso, tathāgatā acchariyadhammasamannāgatā ca; ",
  "mn123:2.7": "abbhutā ceva, āvuso, tathāgatā abbhutadhammasamannāgatā cā”ti. ",
  "mn123:2.8": "Ayañca hidaṁ tesaṁ bhikkhūnaṁ antarākathā vippakatā hoti. ",
  "mn123:2.9": "Atha kho bhagavā sāyanhasamayaṁ paṭisallānā vuṭ